abstract: >-
  The AI Workspace Protocol (AIWP) establishes a verifiable, vendor-neutral contract
  enabling disparate Large Language Models (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini/Antigravity, Codex)
  to start, execute, interrupt, transfer, and resume development sessions with cryptographic
  state verification and zero loss of operational context.
